type: dataset
title: "Swiss SME Websites 2026: 10,000 sites audited, canton by canton"
authors:
  - name: "Hallebardier"
    website: "https://hallebardier.com/"
  - family-names: "Perriard"
    given-names: "Maxime"
date-released: 2026-09-27
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://hallebardier.com/en/swiss-sme-website-study/"
keywords:
  - Switzerland
  - SME
  - websites
  - structured data
  - llms.txt
  - data protection
abstract: >-
  Aggregated measurements of 10,000 websites of Swiss small and medium-sized
  businesses drawn at random from the Swiss commercial register in September
  2026: HTTPS, mobile viewport, structured data, meta description, robots.txt,
  sitemap.xml, llms.txt, privacy page, footer year, platform and HTML reception
  time, per canton, language region and legal form. Proportions only.
